{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41951","headline":"海上和郎戬员外赴倅职 · 李中","name":"海上和郎戬员外赴倅职","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋玉逢秋何起悲，新恩委寄好开眉。\n班升鸳鹭频经岁，任佐龚黄必暂时。\n乍对烟霞吟海峤，应思苹蓼梦江湄。\n一朝凤诏仲徵入，鹏化那教尺鷃知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}